  "title": "The BMI-HDEEG dataset 1",
  "description": "The BMI-HDEEG dataset comprises high-density scalp electroencephalogram (EEG) recordings acquired during sensorimotor rhythm-based brain-computer interface (BCI) tasks. This dataset provides detailed neurophysiological measurements from multiple subjects performing motor imagery and related sensorimotor activities, enabling investigation of cortical dynamics underlying BCI performance and sensorimotor processing.",
